# PCF85063 clock tests

Exercises BCD decoding and encoding across every calendar field, the
oscillator-stop flag that decides whether a reading is trusted, the century
boundary the part's two year digits impose, one-transaction reads and writes,
the lifecycle, and transport failure, against a recording MCU platform that
answers as the part does. No hardware is involved.
